00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:50.540
Chapter 22 Fight

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:07.120
<i>They've got the nose for
it, I'll give them that.</i>

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.600
<i>Damn hounds of the Shogunate...</i>

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:20.910
You're unbelievable.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.580
Still playing around on the rooftops?

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.950
Oh, don't worry, this game of
tag will be over after today.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.120
Ikedaya

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:49.600
Ikedaya

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.580
Pardon us!

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:44.910
We are the Shinsengumi!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.990
We are sweeping all the inns tonight!

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:49.950
From this point on,

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:53.040
resist us and you will be
cut down without mercy!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.120
Insolence will not be permitted!

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:20.150
I'm letting myself in, Tetsunosuke.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.350
It's unusually quiet, isn't it?

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.140
I suppose everyone being out might
have something to do with that.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:39.080
I wanted to have a little chat with you.

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:43.910
But anyway, don't you
think it's just pitiful?

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:46.080
A Vice Commander of the great Shinsengumi

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:47.950
down with a cold at a time like this...

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:50.670
But the truth is...

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:53.600
I'm afraid.

00:04:56.540 --> 00:05:02.950
I heard from Tatsunosuke, but it
seems you're the same way, Tetsu.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:06.610
I suppose that makes us two of a kind.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.420
No, that's not true...

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:16.080
When I was a child,

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:21.540
I loved watching the school of rice fish
swimming in a nearby stream.

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:24.000
When spring had passed
and summer was approaching,

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.580
I'd often go to the irrigation
channel in the neighborhood

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:31.550
and just watch the rice fish
swimming until the sun went down.

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.830
The way they went against
the current of the stream

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:39.580
and swam with all their might
seemed so endearing,

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:42.450
but also so valiant.

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:46.530
I would just gaze at them endlessly.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:50.750
Tetsunosuke...

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:56.040
it seems I've become a
bit too much of a coward.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:06:02.920
I wonder if I have no choice now,
but to let the current take me?

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:08.950
But you...

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:12.830
Oh, sorry about that.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:15.420
I've bored you with old stories.

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.810
Well, I'll excuse myself now.

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:33.410
Run! Run, now!

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.200
Hold!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.670
Do not be daunted! They are not so many!

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.460
Their numbers can be
defeated if we band together!

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:50.350
First, kill those two!

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:08.000
I will say it just once more!

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:11.530
Resist us and you will be
cut down without mercy!

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.950
Surround them! Surround them now!

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:23.170
Turn the tables on them!

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:55.570
I believe...

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.580
I warned you!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.450
Oppose us and you will be cut down!

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:03.330
Show no mercy to those
who are fleeing, either!

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:18.510
Cut them down! Cut them down!

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:20.780
Cut them all down!

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:39.200
Dad...

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:01.540
Damn.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.330
The back door is this way!

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.180
Hurry!

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.950
You bastards!

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:07.690
You're not getting away!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:08.620
You're in the way!

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:12.860
It's only two of them!
Cut them down! Cut them both down!

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.580
We've secured an escape route!

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:17.410
Please, this way! Hurry, Master Yoshida!

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:18.700
Matsuda! Miyabe!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.490
We must retreat for now!

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.410
I refuse!

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:25.120
I am tired of running and hiding!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.770
A couple of wild dogs like this...

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:35.440
Matsuda, hold on!

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.690
Miyabe... Matsuda...

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:52.190
Master!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:03.080
Why are you here?

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:06.710
I believe I suspended you from your
duties and told you to stay there.

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:11.000
I cannot remain in hiding
alone at a time like this!

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.630
I will fight along with you!

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.500
I don't care if I die!

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:16.700
I want to kill as many Mibu ronin as I can,

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:18.660
save our comrades,

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:20.720
and be of some use to you, Master!

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:24.780
Master!

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:29.660
If you insist, Suzu.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:32.650
Go to the Choshu Clan House for
immediate reinforcements for me.

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:35.910
What's the matter?

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:37.980
If you do not hurry, we will be surrounded.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.660
I no longer...

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:47.290
have any home to return to,
except to be by your side.

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:52.670
Even if I go get reinforcements...

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:54.970
Even if we crush the Shinsengumi...

00:10:58.250 --> 00:10:59.850
I do not want to be alone.

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:05.410
In that case,

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:08.490
you can just hurry back and come get me.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:28.750
Father...

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.340
Please watch over Tetsunosuke...

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:55.520
<i>Please wait for me, Master!</i>

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:45.370
Now, what are you gonna do?

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:49.370
You can't run away from
where you are, right?

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:52.870
You'll just have to work up your
courage and take a step forward.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.360
As in all things.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:00.250
Don't underestimate me!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:31.580
Whoops.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:33.700
Heisuke!

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:40.420
Maybe that'll make it a
bit easier for you to use!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:43.090
You idiot! Run!

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:54.060
Heisuke!

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:06.490
I feel insulted now.

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:09.160
Letting your attention
wander at a time like this?

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:29.680
Hey...

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:34.350
You're awfully aggressive tonight.

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:38.350
<i>I'm no match for her in speed or jumping.</i>

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.230
What happened?

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:46.370
There's not a one of all those
<i>kunoichi </i>that were around.

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:47.860
Did they abandon you?

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:49.910
That's none of your business!

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.450
<i>I won't let you take the
battle into the air!</i>

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:54.740
<i>In which case...</i>

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.540
<i>What?!</i>

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:22.250
<i>No...</i>

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:23.480
<i>He's going to finish me.</i>

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:41.340
<i>Susumu...</i>

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.460
<i>Ayu...</i>

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:48.630
<i>Dad...</i>

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.200
Hey!

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:07.950
They've done it!

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:45.080
Shinpachi, I...

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:48.190
Keep quiet! The wound's not that deep.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:32.530
He did it!

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:50.570
Mr. Okita...

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:04.450
What're you doing, Tetsu?!

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:07.940
I don't care how good you are, the odds
are stacked against you if you take him on!

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:09.530
Hurry up and run!

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:22.200
I'm still alive.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.290
<i>What're you doing running away?!</i>

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.880
<i>Go back! Go back!</i>

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:32.430
<i>You have to go back!</i>

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:46.580
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:52.660
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:56.450
<i>If only I were more...</i>

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:57.480
<i>If I were more...</i>

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:26.240
Mr. Okita...

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:32.500
This whole time, I've had it all wrong.

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:36.290
The reason I wanted to become stronger...

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:41.180
wasn't to kill people...

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:51.810
Tetsu...

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:04.780
I won't let anyone die ever again!

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:09.200
Ah, Nagakura! How's it going?

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.040
Are things cleaned up over there?

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.250
Mr. Kondo, we've got trouble!

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:15.580
Tetsunosuke's...

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:22.370
What the hell is he doing here?!

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:24.920
I'm telling you, you're up
against a bad opponent!

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:26.840
He's ready to die!

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:32.850
I'm ready to die too!

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:41.320
It wasn't you.

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:45.690
All this time, the one I've hated
so much that I wanted to kill him...

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:51.500
was the helpless me!

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:06.910
<i>Maiku o nigirishime
hitto pareedo no onpareedo</i>

00:22:06.910 --> 00:22:10.450
<i>Hey, Jimmy, kibun wa doudai?</i>

00:22:10.450 --> 00:22:14.790
<i>Suteeji orireba sasuga no jentoruman</i>

00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:18.520
<i>Hey, Jimmy, kokoro mo kandai!</i>

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:22.400
<i>Jimichi ga yue ni seikatsu sae mo jimi ni</i>

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:26.290
<i>Kotsu-kotsu tsumiagemashou</i>

00:22:26.290 --> 00:22:30.290
<i>Jimichi ni yume ga kanaimasu you ni</i>

00:22:30.290 --> 00:22:34.120
<i>Kyou mo, Jimmy, ikimashou</i>

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:39.660
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:43.590
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:47.500
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:47.500 --> 00:22:51.640
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:11.120
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:11.120 --> 00:23:15.080
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:19.080
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:23.330
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:24.710 --> 00:23:27.210
Next Peacemaker Kurogane

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:27.210
<i>I was wrong.</i>

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:31.500
<i>I was just powerless to act,
held captive by my own emotions.</i>

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:36.510
<i>Next time, Peacemaker Kurogane,
Chapter 23: "Truth."</i>

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:39.820
Chapter 23 Truth

